      "data": {
        "type": "game",
        "name": "Starpine",
        "steam_appid": 3992220,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/43cbed903fb9a0777a0679ff08660cc8.avif?t=1758844965\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a pineapple</strong>, and as such, your only goal is to <strong>reach the stars</strong>. Use your <strong>platforming</strong> skills to jump around unique biomes, from island to island or wall to wall, to reach every star each world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pineapple, you are dropped into a random world with <strong>3 stars</strong> to reach. You can run and jump around the world (and off walls!) to reach the stars using the terrain provided. On your way, you can find <strong>hints</strong>, which <strong>will point towards the nearest (unclaimed) star</strong>. They also conveniently reset after each star is collected, so they can be used again for the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will find <strong>5 unique biomes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The grassy biome</strong> provides a simple shape for navigation and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The purple mossy biome</strong> includes small platforms with long, punishing drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The desert</strong> holds large empty spaces, which can be either powerful or detrimental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clouds</strong> are easy and peaceful, only requiring some wall jumps in tough places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rocky biome</strong> is a mixture of elements, providing a balanced yet challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you happen to fall a bit too far, you can <strong>rewind time</strong> to before your last jump, so you can try again. This keeps the timer going, however, so you won't want to use it too often. You also can't rewind past collecting a star or hint, since that would be a little unfair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, <strong>your time</strong> <strong>to get all 3 stars will be counted</strong>. Compete for the best time on the daily seed. <strong>Global leaderboards</strong> show the best times of all players. If you'd rather play on your own, you can choose a <strong>custom seed</strong> or a <strong>random seed</strong>, and see how fast you can get your first attempts at a given world's stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/2557ee1c0cac3c73812bbede7a90f36e.avif?t=1758844965\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/43cbed903fb9a0777a0679ff08660cc8.avif?t=1758844965\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a pineapple</strong>, and as such, your only goal is to <strong>reach the stars</strong>. Use your <strong>platforming</strong> skills to jump around unique biomes, from island to island or wall to wall, to reach every star each world has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a pineapple, you are dropped into a random world with <strong>3 stars</strong> to reach. You can run and jump around the world (and off walls!) to reach the stars using the terrain provided. On your way, you can find <strong>hints</strong>, which <strong>will point towards the nearest (unclaimed) star</strong>. They also conveniently reset after each star is collected, so they can be used again for the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you will find <strong>5 unique biomes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The grassy biome</strong> provides a simple shape for navigation and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The purple mossy biome</strong> includes small platforms with long, punishing drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The desert</strong> holds large empty spaces, which can be either powerful or detrimental</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The clouds</strong> are easy and peaceful, only requiring some wall jumps in tough places</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rocky biome</strong> is a mixture of elements, providing a balanced yet challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you happen to fall a bit too far, you can <strong>rewind time</strong> to before your last jump, so you can try again. This keeps the timer going, however, so you won't want to use it too often. You also can't rewind past collecting a star or hint, since that would be a little unfair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, <strong>your time</strong> <strong>to get all 3 stars will be counted</strong>. Compete for the best time on the daily seed. <strong>Global leaderboards</strong> show the best times of all players. If you'd rather play on your own, you can choose a <strong>custom seed</strong> or a <strong>random seed</strong>, and see how fast you can get your first attempts at a given world's stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992220/extras/2557ee1c0cac3c73812bbede7a90f36e.avif?t=1758844965\" width=512 height=192 /></span></p>",
